Pitako composes third-party Pi packages and vendors selected MIT skills.

Dependencies (not copied into this repository's source):

- pi-lsp-client (code-yeongyu) is MIT. Its NOTICE explains that the ported LSP
  tools were re-licensed by their author for the Pi ecosystem. Oh My OpenAgent
  itself remains under a different license and is not shipped here.
- @vndv/pi-codegraph is MIT.
- @colbymchenry/codegraph is MIT.
- @dietrichgebert/ponytail is MIT. Pitako loads the ponytail skill only.
- @juicesharp/rpiv-todo is MIT. Pitako loads the extension as the session TODO layer.
- Pi (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent) is MIT.

Vendored MIT material (see THIRD_PARTY.md and docs/licenses/):

- Caveman coding skills (Julius Brussee). skills/ is MIT. BSL engine/runtime
  paths are not shipped.
- Selected pstack skills and principles (Lauren Tan / official Cursor pstack
  plugin). Orchestration, poteto-mode, and subagent runtimes are not shipped.
